"po zalogowaniu – e-mail mówi tylko, że coś na Ciebie czeka."
msgstr ""
"Conversations with the organiser and other participants. You read messages "
"here, after logging in – the e-mail only tells you that something is waiting "
"for you."

#: templates/web/chat/inbox.html:22
