msgstr "You don't have any messages yet"

#: templates/web/chat/inbox.html:49
msgid ""
"Masz pytanie o zawody? Napisz do organizatora – odpowie jeden z "
"koordynatorów."
msgstr ""
"Have a question about the competition? Write to the organiser – one of the "
"coordinators will reply."

#: templates/web/chat/inbox.html:50
