"się z tego czegoś nauczyć bez wglądu w pracę."
msgstr ""
"It reaches the participant panel once the stage results are announced. Write "
"it so that one can learn something from it without seeing the solution."

#: templates/web/reviewer/detail.html:326
msgid "Komentarz wewnętrzny (dla komitetu)"
msgstr "Internal comment (for the committee)"

#: templates/web/reviewer/detail.html:328
